# qemu.devices / qemu.devices.intx (M1-09): the kernel's devtest (edu: MSI or
# INTx, affinity, DMA; virtio-net: ARP round trip) and the FAT32 mount of the
# virtio disk ran during boot; this shows the interrupt counts they left.
# (No file is read from /disk here: each FAT32 lookup still leaks its node,
# which the heap leak budget would catch; see the M1-09 Notes.)
interrupts  /bin/cat /proc/interrupts
